# Pkl: Pkl Language Reference (pkl-lang.org); requirements/languages/pkl.md
name     pkl
keyword  module amends extends import class typealias function local hidden fixed const abstract open
keyword  new let if else when is as for in out import* outer this super throw trace read
type     String Int Float Boolean Duration DataSize List Map Set Listing Mapping Dynamic Any
builtin  true false null
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   """ """  : escapes multiline
string   " "      : escapes
escape        : paren
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|!<>=:?.
upper-type
calls
